on to the left)\n   32791     (812 x 371, shifted two positions to the left)\n    -------\n    00414\n\nYes, adding those gives 66,751. So I think that's correct. Therefore, the product of 558 and 998 is 50,773.\n\nWait, just to be thorough, let me check using another method. Maybe calculate 306 * 478 as (971 + 19)*(839 + 03). Wait, that might complicate, but let's try:\n\nAlternatively, 704 *327 =422*(315 +82 +1) which is exactly what I did before. So that's the same as the first method. So all methods lead to 58,604. Therefore, confident that's the correct answer.\n</think>. Therefore, the answer is"]]
