t{Tens}) + 119,200 \\, (\\text{Hundreds})\n   \\]\n   - First, add the ones and tens:\n     \\[\n     1,788 + 41,720 = 43,508\n     \\]\n   - Then add the hundreds:\n     \\[\n     43,508 + 119,200 = 162,708\n     \\]\n\n**Final Answer:** The product of 596 and 273 is **162,708**.",
