igit** (0):  .\n   \\(163 \\times 0 = 0\\) (shifted one place to the left: \\(0\\)).  .\n3. Multiply 163 by the **hundreds place digit** (800):  .\n   \\(163 \\times 800 = 130,\\!400\\).  .\n\nAnswer:  .\nNow, sum all the step results:  .\n\\(1,\\!304 + 0 + 130,\\!400 = 131,\\!704\\). Therefore, the answer is"]] 17%|#6        | 83/500 [29:29<26:24,  3.80s/it]
