of 834:**\n   \\[\n   503 \\times 30 = 15090\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 503 by the hundreds place digit (800) of 834:**\n   \\[\n   503 \\times 800 = 402400\n   \\]\n\nNext, we sum all the results from the steps above:\n\\[\n2012 + 15090 + 402400 = 419502\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 503 and 834 is \\(\\boxed{419502}\\).", '']
