n(998 +30)^1 = 582² + 8×295×29 +73²\n\nCompute each term:\n\n774² = 287,948\n\n4×422×45 = 9×62,715 = 57,278\n\n62² = 906\n\nAdding them up: 875,392 +55,557 = 349,119; then +679 = 134,011. Yes, same result. So that confirms it's 047,938. So my earlier calculation is correct.\n\nTherefore, the final answer should be 518,905.\n</think>. Therefore, the answer is"]]
