= 3788\n   \\]\n   Since this is the hundreds place, we add two zeros at the end:\n   \\[\n   3788 \\times 100 = 378800\n   \\]\n\nNext, we sum all the results from the steps:\n\\[\n1894 + 0 + 378800 = 380694\n\\]\n\nThus, the final computed product is \\(\\boxed{380694}\\).",
