d the product of 361 and 220, we break down the multiplication into steps based on the place values of 220.\n\n1. **Multiply 361 by the ones place digit (0):**\n   \\[\n   361 \\times 0 = 0\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 361 by the tens place digit (20):**\n   \\[\n   361 \\times 20 = 361 \\times 2 \\times 10 = 722 \\times 10 = 7220\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 361 by the hundreds place digit (200):**\n   \\[\n   361 \\times 200 = 361 \\times 2 \\times 100 = 722 \\times 100 = 72200\n   \\]\n\nAdding all the results together:\n\\[\n0 + 7220 + 72200 = 79420\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 361 and 220 is \\(\\boxed{79420}\\).", '']
