tiply 317 by the ones place digit 2 of 222:  \n   \\( 317 \\times 2 = 634 \\).  \n2. Multiply 317 by the tens place digit 20 of 222:  \n   \\( 317 \\times 20 = 6,\\!340 \\).  \n3. Multiply 317 by the hundreds place digit 200 of 222:  \n   \\( 317 \\times 200 = 63,\\!400 \\).  \n\nAnswer:  \nNow, sum all the step results:  \n\\( 634 + 6,\\!340 + 63,\\!400 = 70,\\!374 \\).  \nSo, the final computed product is \\boxed{70374}.", '']
