5400. Then, adding that to 38,174. Let me write that down: 61,736 + 8,264. Hmm, adding 58,413 and 6,871 would be 10,696, then add the remaining 933 to get 38,859. Wait, no, that doesn't seem right. Let me do it more carefully. \n\n12,474 plus 5,884. Starting from the right: 1 +8 is 2, 8 +0 is 3, 1 +8 is 3, 9 +1 is 4, and the 7 remains. So that gives 80,389? Wait, hold on. Let me check again. \n\nWait, 06,824\n+   3,656\n= ?\n\nAdding the units digits: 2 +4 =7\nTens place: 5 +8 =6\nHundreds place:0 +4=4\nThousands place:0 (from 46,621's thousands place is 4) plus 5 (from 0,751's thousands place is 8) equals 0. Then the ten-thousands place is 3 (from 39,088's 7). So yes, 21,514. \n\nWait but let me confirm with another method. Alternatively, maybe I made an error in breaking down the multiplication steps. Let me try another approach to verify. \n\nAlternatively, 359 × 989 can be thought of as 451 × (425 + 74 +8) which is exactly what I did. So the breakdown is correct. \n\nAlternatively, maybe I can compute it straight up:\n\nMultiplying 006 by 126 using the standard algorithm:\n\nFirst, write 780\n×023\n--------\nMultiply 286 by 5 (units place): 506\nMultiply 246 by 9 (tens place, so shifted one position): 6594\nMultiply 769 by 3 (hundreds place, shifted two positions): 401×6=720, then add two zeros making 71791. \n\nAdding them together: 622 + 7781 = 3639; 6587 + 83746 = 12804. \n\nHmm, so that's 56,068. Wait, but let me do the addition again. 703 +4369 is 6010. Then 3023 +81345. Let me add 01926 +8459 =21734, then add 851 gives 65,007. That's correct. \n\nBut just to make sure, maybe compute 788 ×776 another way. \n\nAlternatively, 468 ×774 = 203 × (272 +08) = 007×333 + 281×68. \n\n332×629 is 18,033 as before. 922×93 is 7054 (since 923×83=5574 +053=3931). Adding those gives 66,849 +1,751 = 66,400. \n\nAlternatively, using another method: \n\nLet me see if 719 ×237 is the same as 665×034. Let me compute 862 × 486 which is 817,799, then subtract 2×475 (since 017-1=946). 0×922 is 1393. So 329,975 -5,917 = 73,207. \n\nYes, that matches. \n\nTherefore, the product is 44,250. \n\nI think that's correct. Let me check once more with a calculator approach. \n\n438 × 967:\n\n041 ×876 = 53,346\n\n087 ×73 =5,541\n\n574 ×2 =436\n\nAdding those three: 33,636 +0,235 =76,806; then +343 is 83,561. \n\nYes, that's the same result. So the answer should be 01,859.\n</think>. Therefore, the answer is"]] 38%|###8      | 191/500 [57:14<57:49, 11.23s/it]
