it (20):**\n   \\[\n   344 \\times 20 = 6880\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 344 by the hundreds place digit (400):**\n   \\[\n   344 \\times 400 = 137600\n   \\]\n\nNext, we sum the results of these steps:\n\\[\n0 + 6880 + 137600 = 144480\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 344 and 420 is \\(\\boxed{144480}\\).", '']
