ns place digit (90)**:  .\n   \\( 104 \\times 90 = 9,360 \\).  .\n3. Multiply 104 by the **hundreds place digit (200)**:  .\n   \\( 104 \\times 200 = 20,800 \\).  .\n\nAnswer:  .\nNow, sum all the step results:  .\n\\( 416 + 9,360 + 20,800 = 30,576 \\). Therefore, the answer is"]] 40%|####      | 202/500 [59:52<45:45,  9.21s/it]  
