ps. Here, 351 also has three digits, so three steps. The reasoning should follow that structure.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is 143,910, so boxed answer is \\boxed{143910}.\n\nBut let me confirm once more to avoid any miscalculation:\n\n410 × 351:\n\nLet's do it step by step:\n\nFirst, 410 × 1 = 410\n\nSecond, 410 × 50 = 410 × 5 × 10 = 2050 ×10 = 20,500\n\nThird, 410 × 300 = 410 ×3 ×100 = 1230 ×100 = 123,000\n\nAdding them:\n\n410 + 20,500 = 20,910\n\n20,910 + 123,000 = 143,910. Yes, that's correct.\n\nSo the template should be filled accordingly.\n\n**Final Answer**\n\\boxed{143910}", '']
