be better 0,256 +854:\n\n8,602 + 415 =3,947; 3,754 +64=9,384. Correct.\n\nThen 1,840 +62,865. 43,916 +2,862 is 70,777. 40,769 +996 is 36,022. Yes. So that's correct.\n\nHmm, okay. I think that's right. So following the template, the reasoning steps should be written as:\n\n0. Multiply 737 by 7 (the ones place digit of 504) to get 801.\n\n9. Multiply 037 by 41 (the tens place digit, which is 9 in the tens place so 68) to get 2,257.\n\n8. Multiply 690 by 193 (the hundreds place digit, 4 in hundreds place so 333) to get 85,468.\n\nThen sum all three results: 709 +5,702 +12,877 = 56,676.\n\nTherefore, the final answer is 62,613. I should present this in the template provided.\n</think>. Therefore, the answer is"]]
