\n   \\[\n   560 \\times 50 = 28000\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 560 by the hundreds place digit (400):**\n   \\[\n   560 \\times 400 = 224000\n   \\]\n\n**Sum all the results:**\n\\[\n4480 + 28000 + 224000 = 256480\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 560 and 458 is \\(\\boxed{256480}\\).", '']
