 digit (50):\n   \\[\n   303 \\times 50 = 303 \\times 5 \\times 10 = 1515 \\times 10 = 15150\n   \\]\n\n3. Multiply 303 by the hundreds place digit (300):\n   \\[\n   303 \\times 300 = 303 \\times 3 \\times 100 = 909 \\times 100 = 90900\n   \\]\n\nSumming all the results from each step:\n\\[\n606 + 15150 + 90900 = 106656\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 303 and 352 is \\(\\boxed{106656}\\).", '']
