ly 618 by 1:  .\n   \\( 618 \\times 1 = 618 \\).  .\n\n2. **Tens place (60):**  .\n   Multiply 618 by 60:  .\n   \\( 618 \\times 6 = 3,\\!708 \\), then add a zero:  .\n   \\( 3,\\!708 \\times 10 = 37,\\!080 \\).  .\n\n3. **Hundreds place (900):**  .\n   Multiply 618 by 900:  .\n   \\( 618 \\times 9 = 5,\\!562 \\), then add two zeros:  .\n   \\( 5,\\!562 \\times 100 = 556,\\!200 \\).  .\n\n**Sum all results:**  .\n\\( 618 + 37,\\!080 + 556,\\!200 = 593,\\!898 \\).  .\n\nAnswer:  .\nNow, sum all the step results: \\( 618 + 37,\\!080 + 556,\\!200 = 593,\\!898 \\). Therefore, the answer is"]] 58%|#####7    | 289/500 [1:36:35<59:09, 16.82s/it]  
