 the multiplication into three steps.\n\n1. Multiply 662 by the ones place digit (6):  .\n   \\( 662 \\times 6 = 3,\\!972 \\).\n\n2. Multiply 662 by the tens place digit (50):  .\n   \\( 662 \\times 50 = 33,\\!100 \\).\n\n3. Multiply 662 by the hundreds place digit (300):  .\n   \\( 662 \\times 300 = 198,\\!600 \\).\n\nAnswer:  .\nNow, sum all the step results: \\( 3,\\!972 + 33,\\!100 + 198,\\!600 = 235,\\!672 \\).  .\nSo, the final computed product is **235672**.\n\n# Final Answer. Therefore, the answer is"]] 66%|######6   | 331/500 [1:47:58<15:04,  5.35s/it]
