 \\[\n     19,728 + 54,800 = 74,528\n     \\]\n\n**Final Answer:** The product of 274 and 272 is 74,528.\n\nI need to present this in the template provided, ensuring each step is clearly shown as per the user's example. The initial mistake was due to confusing the numbers, so I must be careful to use the correct numbers now. Let me structure it properly following the template.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 274 and 272 is \\boxed{74528}.\n</think>\n\n",
