ep-by-step reasoning as outlined in the template:\n\n1. **Multiply 930 by the ones place digit (0) of 210:**\n   \\[\n   930 \\times 0 = 0\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 930 by the tens place digit (10) of 210:**\n   \\[\n   930 \\times 10 = 9300\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 930 by the hundreds place digit (200) of 210:**\n   \\[\n   930 \\times 200 = 186000\n   \\]\n\nNext, we sum all the results from the steps above:\n\\[\n0 + 9300 + 186000 = 195300\n\\]\n\nThus, the final computed product of 930 and 210 is \\(\\boxed{195300}\\).', '']
