.\n\nBut let me confirm once more with another method.\n\nAlternatively, using distributive property:\n\n146 ×377 = 146×(300 +70 +7) = (146×300) + (146×70) + (146×7) = 43,800 +10,220 +1,022 = 55,042.\n\nYes, that's correct. So the final answer should be 55,042.\n\nTherefore, the correct steps are as above, and the answer is 55,042. I must have made a mistake earlier when I thought I got 55,142 due to a different problem's numbers. So the final answer here is 55,042.", '']
