7,400\n\nAdding them all together:\n\n2,744  \n+13,720  \n=16,464  \n\n16,464  \n+617,400  \n=633,864  \n\nYes, that\'s correct. Alternatively, using another method like distributive property:\n\n686 × 924 = 686 × (900 + 24) = 686×900 + 686×24 = 617,400 + 16,464 = 633,864.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is 633,864.\n\nI need to make sure the reasoning follows the template provided, breaking down each digit\'s multiplication step.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 686 and 924 is \\boxed{633864}.', '']
